observed = "The two FlatKVOnly cases compared the previous MigrateBank commit-info surface with the FlatKVOnly surface. All other mode cases passed."
repair = "The fixture now completes the mode switch with a real FlatKVOnly commit before capturing its baseline, asserting retained values, lattice continuity, exact version and the single-store commit-info shape. All exact comparisons remain."
